    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Actually in SPA implementation, this breaks in the same way. What should be an option is *what to do* for writing after dispose happens,\r\n\r\n1. vanilla, where dispose is on the same page: write on dispose\r\n2. angular, vue etc. with Vue Router, where dispose happens together with a page change: no write after disposed",
