    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This test is supposed to be close to what happens in [Angular IS](https://github.com/algolia/angular-instantsearch/blob/master/src/instantsearch/instantsearch.ts#L247) and [Vue IS](https://github.com/algolia/vue-instantsearch/blob/513017a47d38ccddd0557c01ce732e6e5e7648d6/src/util/createInstantSearchComponent.js#L71-L78) when a route unmounts. \r\n\r\nMaybe we can try to be even closer to what's happening in Angular IS and Vue IS by simulating the cascading unmounting that occurs on route change. I'll do some research and update here.\r\n",
    "commit_id": "f2477f6f8234ff85128fb9e36f03ad12a08e33f6",
